@startuml home-isolation
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "PT Sans"
skinparam shadowing false
title Home isolation: shared file vs isolated home-owned login
left to right direction
package "shared: supported file-backed adapter" {
  folder "Managed home A" as a
  folder "Managed home B" as b
  file "Native credential file" as n
  a --> n : credential link
  b --> n : credential link
}
package "isolated: one home-owned login per home" {
  folder "Managed home C" as c
  folder "Managed home D" as d
  database "Login C" as lc
  database "Login D" as ld
  c --> lc
  d --> ld
}
note bottom of c
Claude macOS: always isolated in Curator.
Muse: isolated/shared admission uses explicit file backend (rc.7).
Inherited authentication: per-home login unnecessary (CIP-0010 Draft).
end note
@enduml
